{"hookSpecificOutput": {"hookEventName": "PreToolUse", "permissionDecision": "deny", "permissionDecisionReason": "dangerous-ops-guard [secret-exposure]: shell read of a credential-bearing path. Reference the single environment variable an integration needs; never print secret files. [command-sha256:a67f9df6ce5bc6c647557a9b582ca687cf5937b6ef793c375649f3a89b92e4e5] If you truly intend this, run it in a shell outside the harness, or update harness/hooks/lib/dangerous_ops_guard.py to exempt the pattern."}}
